            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Bento for macOS 0.2.40

- Short grips resize two apps; long shared grips resize groups of slots.
- Updating or quitting keeps windows in place, including minimized apps.
- Installation no longer waits for windows to restore their old positions.

Includes 0.2.39’s shared-grip, slot-preview and full-screen improvements. Downloads include macOS and the current Windows portable app (Windows 11 x64, .NET 10 Desktop Runtime).
]]></description>
